{
  "id": "table",
  "name": "Table",
  "layer": "components",
  "function": [
    "display"
  ],
  "status": "stable",
  "summary": "Tabla de datos con filas seleccionables, orden por columna y fila de detalle opcional.",
  "supersedes": [
    "table-dense",
    "table-expandable"
  ],
  "api": {
    "generics": [
      {
        "param": "T",
        "default": "any",
        "describes": "La fila"
      }
    ],
    "types": [
      {
        "name": "TableColumn",
        "generic": true,
        "members": [
          [
            "key",
            "string"
          ],
          [
            "label",
            "string"
          ],
          [
            "width",
            "number | string"
          ],
          [
            "align",
            "'left' | 'right' | 'center'"
          ],
          [
            "mono",
            "boolean"
          ],
          [
            "sortable",
            "boolean"
          ],
          [
            "sortValue",
            "(row: T) => string | number"
          ],
          [
            "render",
            "(row: T) => React.ReactNode"
          ]
        ]
      }
    ],
    "members": [
      {
        "name": "columns",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "TableColumn<T>[]",
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "name": "rows",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "T[]",
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "name": "rowKey",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "name": "onRowClick",
        "kind": "event",
        "type": "(row: T) => void"
      },
      {
        "name": "selectedKey",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "string | number"
      },
      {
        "name": "density",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "Density",
        "note": "'default'"
      },
      {
        "name": "sort",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "TableSort | null",
        "note": "Controlado: el dueño ordena (también en servidor); el grid solo pinta y emite"
      },
      {
        "name": "onSortChange",
        "kind": "event",
        "type": "(sort: TableSort | null) => void"
      },
      {
        "name": "sortable",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "boolean",
        "note": "true"
      },
      {
        "name": "caption",
        "kind": "prop",
        "type": "string",
        "note": "Nombre de la tabla para el lector de pantalla: <caption> visualmente oculto. Si la vista ya la titula, repite ese titulo aqui."
      }
    ],
    "note": "API real desde sep-2026: density/sort/onSortChange/sortable. Los nombres defaultSort/dense/renderDetail nunca se construyeron."
  },
  "variants": [
    {
      "value": "default",
      "use": "Lectura y navegación."
    },
    {
      "value": "dense",
      "use": "Más de 20 filas visibles; back-office."
    }
  ],
  "conformance": {
    "inherits": [
      "data-grid"
    ],
    "criteria": [
      {
        "id": "tb-1",
        "rule": "El zebra sale de --surface-sunken, nunca de un rgba a mano.",
        "level": "must",
        "verify": "automated"
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-2",
        "rule": "Si la fila es clickeable es un elemento enfocable con rol de botón o enlace, no un div con onClick.",
        "level": "must",
        "verify": "automated"
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-3",
        "rule": "El header ordenable anuncia aria-sort.",
        "level": "must",
        "verify": "automated"
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-4",
        "rule": "Cifras, placas e IDs en --type-data.",
        "level": "must",
        "verify": "visual"
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-5",
        "rule": "La tabla se nombra: con caption el <caption> existe en el DOM (visualmente oculto), y el lector la anuncia por su nombre.",
        "level": "must",
        "verify": "automated"
      }
    ]
  },
  "composition": {
    "shells": [
      "data-grid"
    ],
    "allowDeviation": true
  },
  "tokens": [
    "--type-data",
    "--surface-sunken",
    "--border-subtle"
  ],
  "nonGoals": [
    "Edición en celda, selección masiva, árbol y timeline: agregan estado y flujo de trabajo sobre la grid, así que son patterns (filterable-editable-table, bulk-actions-table, table-tree, table-timeline), no variantes.",
    "Virtualización: la decide el codebase destino según su volumen real."
  ],
  "platforms": {
    "web": "reference",
    "angular": "n/a",
    "flutter": "n/a"
  },
  "reference": {
    "src": "components/Table.jsx",
    "states": "docs/cards/display.card.html",
    "demo": "docs/demos/table.html"
  }
}
